Package: INFUSE
Type: Package
Title: Integrating Functional Annotations into Multi-Ancestry Fine-Mapping
Version: 0.0.2.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Guangxin", "Chen", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "chen4422@purdue.edu",
           comment = c(affiliation = "Purdue University")),
    person("Boran", "Gao", role = "aut",
           comment = c(affiliation = "Purdue University")))
Description: Provides tools for multi-ancestry fine-mapping using a sum of
    single effects framework, with optional integration of functional
    annotations to improve prior specification and variant prioritization.
    Supports ancestry-specific variant availability through conditional ancestry
    configurations and includes joint linkage-disequilibrium discrepancy diagnostics.
